h2 NASA's CHAPEA Mission 2 @17,87,694,21
text After a year living and working inside a simulated Mars habitat, the CHAPEA Mission 2 crew is preparing to conclude their 365-day mission. During their stay, they lived as if on Mars, growing crops, managing limited resources, and navigating communication delays. The crew will exit the habitat on Oct. 31. @17,120,694,61
link "Mars Exploration" https://www.nasa.gov/humans-in-space/nasas-simulated-mars-crew-marks-one-year-inside-habitat/ @17,193,694,20
