    text FEATURED VIDEO @17,609,694,20
    h3 This is Not an Exercise @17,641,694,19
    text When a newly discovered asteroid looked like it could threaten Earth, NASA and scientists worldwide sprang into action. “Planetary Defenders: This Is Not an Exercise” reveals how experts around the globe worked together to track the asteroid, model its future path, assess the risks, and eventually determine it posed no danger. @17,672,694,81
