    metric Today "Image Of The Day" @17,865,610,65
    text Martian Dawn @17,942,610,21
    text The captivating shapes of wind-carved crags called yardangs are revealed in this zoomed-in crop of a broader panorama captured by NASA’s Curiosity Mars rover. Scientists are eager to learn more about how the yardang layer formed. @17,975,610,61
